# fixtures/tv-layouts — how a library folder is laid out, and what each file is (Phase 16 E4)
#
# path | kind | title | year | season | episode
#
# path: relative to a library root, folders separated by "/". kind: episode (of the series
# title/year, at season/episode), movie (title/year), or extra (featurettes, interviews,
# menus: not a film, not an episode, and never searched for). Release groups are invented.
#
# A. The author's own layout (2026-11-08), names kept, groups replaced: a show folder with
#    a season range in its name; Season N folders; extras in their own Season N folders;
#    and the companion film nested inside the show's folder with its own extras.
